\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">晟</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>明亮；清楚</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">セイ・ジョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あきらか</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">晨</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>早晨；清晨</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あした・とき・あさ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">曖</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>暗；不清晰</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">アイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">くら.い</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">朕</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>朕（帝王自称）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">チン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">柊</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>柊树；刺桂</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><